  "details": "Since it was a problem that had existed for a long time, I was working on increasing the distance between the objects, but the symptom has worsened since this update. For example, with a poster on the wall, there was no problem if you separated the poster 1 cm from the wall before, but now Z fight will occur if you do not separate it 10 cm. This is unnatural because the poster appears to float in the air. It is not possible to deal with it by modifying the creator. This is a problem only for the Quest version. Please respond.",
